# One case per line: rule ‖ verb ‖ source ‖ result. A rule is a left side of Syntax.md, with #n when it repeats.
# The source escapes \n, \t and \\. The result is recorded by `MOTE_BLESS=1 cargo test -p mote-syntax grammar`.
# A token rule is lexed and its result is the token and comment names; a node rule is parsed and its result is the tree or the first error.
Whitespace ‖ accept ‖ \t  \t ‖ Eof
Whitespace ‖ reject ‖ x ‖ Ident Newline Eof
LineComment#1 ‖ accept ‖ // note ‖ LineComment Eof
LineComment#1 ‖ reject ‖ / note ‖ Slash Ident Newline Eof
LineComment#2 ‖ accept ‖ //// banner ‖ LineComment Eof
LineComment#2 ‖ reject ‖ /// doc ‖ DocComment Eof
DocComment ‖ accept ‖ /// doc ‖ DocComment Eof
DocComment ‖ reject ‖ // plain ‖ LineComment Eof
LineComment#3 ‖ accept ‖ x /// after code ‖ Ident LineComment Newline Eof
LineComment#3 ‖ reject ‖ /// at line start ‖ DocComment Eof
BlockComment ‖ accept ‖ /* a /* nested */ b */ ‖ BlockComment Eof
BlockComment ‖ reject ‖ /* open ‖ error: the comment is never closed
Newline ‖ accept ‖ a\nb ‖ Ident Newline Ident Newline Eof
Newline ‖ reject ‖ +\n+ ‖ Plus Plus Eof
Eof ‖ accept ‖  ‖ Eof
Eof ‖ reject ‖ "open ‖ error: the string is never closed
Ident#1 ‖ accept ‖ _name9 ‖ Ident Newline Eof
Ident#1 ‖ reject ‖ 9 ‖ Int(Decimal 9 none) Newline Eof
Int#1 ‖ accept ‖ 0xFF_u8 ‖ Int(Hexadecimal 255 U8) Newline Eof
Int#1 ‖ reject ‖ 0xZ ‖ error: the number has no digits
Int#2 ‖ accept ‖ 0b1010i16 ‖ Int(Binary 10 I16) Newline Eof
Int#2 ‖ reject ‖ 0b2 ‖ error: the number has no digits
Int#3 ‖ accept ‖ 0o17 ‖ Int(Octal 15 none) Newline Eof
Int#3 ‖ reject ‖ 0o8 ‖ error: the number has no digits
Int#4 ‖ accept ‖ 1_000_u32 ‖ Int(Decimal 1000 U32) Newline Eof
Int#4 ‖ reject ‖ _1 ‖ Ident Newline Eof
Float#1 ‖ accept ‖ 1.5e3f32 ‖ Float(1500 F32) Newline Eof
Float#1 ‖ reject ‖ 1. ‖ Int(Decimal 1 none) Dot Eof
Float#2 ‖ accept ‖ 2E+10 ‖ Float(20000000000 none) Newline Eof
Float#2 ‖ reject ‖ 2e ‖ error: the number is malformed
Int Dot Int ‖ accept ‖ a.0.1 ‖ Ident Dot Int(Decimal 0 none) Dot Int(Decimal 1 none) Newline Eof
Int Dot Int ‖ reject ‖ 0.1 ‖ Float(0.1 none) Newline Eof
String ‖ accept ‖ "a\\"b $x" ‖ String Newline Eof
String ‖ reject ‖ "open ‖ error: the string is never closed
InterpStart ‖ accept ‖ "a${x}" ‖ InterpStart Ident InterpEnd Newline Eof
InterpStart ‖ reject ‖ "a" ‖ String Newline Eof
InterpMid ‖ accept ‖ "a${x}b${y}c" ‖ InterpStart Ident InterpMid Ident InterpEnd Newline Eof
InterpMid ‖ reject ‖ "a${x}c" ‖ InterpStart Ident InterpEnd Newline Eof
